2026-11-06T03:01:35.2576587Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2577019Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2577338Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2577642Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2578082Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2578498Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2594168Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2595022Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2606020Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2606727Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2607251Z 
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2608155Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-06T03:01:35.2608861Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
